@base = http://localhost:5103
@alice = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@bob = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Get (JSON presenter)
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}

### Get (text presenter): same interactor, another presentation
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}?format=text

### Withdraw 100 €
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100 }

### Transfer from Alice to Bob
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 250 }

### Withdrawal refused (400)
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{bob}}/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 99999 }
